Devices: switches, access points and routers olr can read

Usage:
  olr devices [command]

Available Commands:
  add         Record a device olr may read
  rm          Forget a device without changing it
  set         Operate on one device
  show        Inspect managed devices

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for devices

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr devices [command] --help" for more information about a command.
